      "v": 1,
      "zh": "当下，嫩的儿子约书亚从什亭暗暗打发两个人作探子，吩咐说：「你们去窥探那地和耶利哥。」于是二人去了，来到一个妓女名叫喇合的家里，就在那里躺卧。",
      "en": "Joshua son of Nun sent two spies out from Shittim secretly and instructed them:[NOTE:1] “Find out what you can about the land, especially Jericho.”[NOTE:2] They stopped at the house of a prostitute named Rahab and spent the night there.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “Joshua, son of Nun, sent from Shittim two men, spies, secretly, saying.”",
        "Heb “go, see the land, and Jericho.”map For location see Map5-B2; Map6-E1; Map7-E1; Map8-E3; Map10-A2; Map11-A1.",
        "Heb “they went and entered the house of a woman, a prostitute, and her name was Rahab, and they slept there.”"
