      "v": 9,
      "zh": "对他们说：「我知道耶和华已经把这地赐给你们，并且因你们的缘故我们都惊慌了。这地的一切居民在你们面前心都消化了；",
      "en": "She said to the men, “I know the Lord is handing this land over to you.[NOTE:1] We are absolutely terrified of you,[NOTE:2] and all who live in the land are cringing before[NOTE:3] you.[NOTE:4]",
